	| Status                  | Approved                 |   |
	And I generate the product purchase ID value for the product purchase made by "Korlcs - ${staticProjectName}" for "DXP Production"
	And I create a product consumption for an account with the name "Korlcs - ${staticProjectName}" and the product "DXP Production" on koroneiki with the following values
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp1 | propertyValue1 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp2 | propertyValue2 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp3 | propertyValue3 |
	And I create a product purchase for an account with the name "Korlcs - ${staticProjectName}" and the product "Platinum Subscription" on koroneiki with the following values
	| End Date                | ${staticEndDate}         | |
	| Original End Date       | ${staticOriginalEndDate} | |
	| Perpetual               | false                    | |
